<para>Not implemented error. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classcslt_1_1NotImplementedError" kindref="compound">NotImplementedError</ref> represents an error where a requested operation or feature has not yet been implemented.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Example Usage:</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="keywordflow">throw</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/><ref refid="classcslt_1_1NotImplementedError_1a1e9964589285aebfb85bc38c8b5c3781" kindref="member">NotImplementedError</ref>();</highlight></codeline>
